WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:10.562
The farmer's wife went into the house.

2
00:00:10.563 --> 00:00:13.388
Tom jumped onto the window.

3
00:00:13.389 --> 00:00:16.069
He looked into the kitchen.

4
00:00:16.070 --> 00:00:19.578
The farmer's wife had more milk.

5
00:00:19.579 --> 00:00:31.727
She poured it into a tall pot.

6
00:00:31.728 --> 00:00:37.731
Then she left.

7
00:00:37.732 --> 00:00:40.224
Tom licked his lips.

8
00:00:40.225 --> 00:00:42.923
He leaned closer . . .

9
00:00:42.924 --> 00:00:46.298
Tom fell onto the kitchen floor!

10
00:00:46.299 --> 00:00:50.142
Just then a mouse peeped out of a hole.

11
00:00:50.146 --> 00:00:55.666
"What are you doing here?" she asked.

12
00:00:55.667 --> 00:00:58.302
"Nothing," Tom said.

13
00:00:58.303 --> 00:01:03.941
But he was looking at the tall pot.

14
00:01:03.942 --> 00:01:05.945
Tom jumped up.

15
00:01:05.946 --> 00:01:08.660
He stepped slowly toward the milk.

16
00:01:08.661 --> 00:01:12.331
Tom stood on his back legs.

17
00:01:12.332 --> 00:01:16.948
He peeked into the pot.

18
00:01:16.949 --> 00:01:21.072
"Mmm!" Tom said.

19
00:01:21.073 --> 00:01:23.964
"The milk smells wonderful!"

20
00:01:23.965 --> 00:01:27.475
Tom dipped a paw into the pot.

21
00:01:27.476 --> 00:01:30.129
But he couldn't reach the milk.

22
00:01:30.130 --> 00:01:33.872
Tom leaned closer . . .

23
00:01:33.873 --> 00:01:36.431
"Ahh!" Tom cried.

24
00:01:36.432 --> 00:01:40.296
The pot tipped over!

